  "historyNote": "#9776-B, eff 10-1-10; ss by #12650, INTERIM, eff 10-24-19, EXPIRED: 4-22-19 New. #12775, eff 5-7-19; ss by #14255, eff 5-23-25, EXPIRES: 5-23-35",
